# kernel block, with a fail-fast check for FlashInfer runtime page sizes (>= 0.7.1). Context: vllm-project/vllm#59203.
# Validated on EC2 g7e.48xlarge (TP8) and g7e.24xlarge (TP4) with --block-size 64; not yet merged upstream.
